VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p61-17', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 61, 'Discussion: Content filtering is the process of inspecting information as it traverses a cross- domain solution and determines if the information meets a predefined policy. Redundant', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p61-17', 0, 26, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '36B25B80BCC1CE2C8E322AF26E38595B73A2F4D4315D83778148283FABC58CFA', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
