VALUES ('doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p89-2', 'doc-14-nist-sp-800-53', '', 89, 'engineering). Effective training includes techniques for recognizing suspicious emails, use of removable systems in non-secure settings, and the potential targeting of individuals at home.', 'kb-doc-14-nist-sp-800-53-p89-2', 0, 24, '14-nist-sp-800-53', 'retrieved', '2E06A60C6A27AA51E5C1F308B3BCCA087C36979A2CE6B6468A9856DD61AB785F', 'v1', '{"source_id": "14-nist-sp-800-53", "version": "retrieved", "corpus_version": "v1", "knowledge_object_type": "REFERENCE_CONCEPT"}')
